  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nHello WHATWG team,\r\n\r\nI am pleased to inform you that I have completed a full Chinese translation of the HTML Standard. The translation covers the entire content of the standard and is intended to make the document more accessible to Chinese-speaking developers and enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nThe translation can be accessed here: https://htmlspecs.com/.\r\nrepository: https://github.com/JinDX/htmlspecs.com\r\n\r\nI kindly request that you add my translation to the list of translations on the following page: https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/Translations.\r\n\r\nIf there are any additional steps I need to follow, or if further revisions are necessary, please let me know.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nJin Dongxun",
